url: "https://github.com/jretamav/winkler-beam-interactive-suite"
abstract: >-
  An open-source educational toolkit that evaluates and visualizes, in real
  time, the exact analytical solution of an infinite beam on a Winkler elastic
  foundation under three loading scenarios: concentrated point load,
  concentrated moment, and uniformly distributed load over a finite length.
  The suite implements the closed-form solutions in vectorized NumPy and
  exposes a Matplotlib-based graphical user interface with parameter sliders
  and an inspection text box, designed to support structural engineering
  education at the undergraduate level.
